 ],
 "literal": "At the time of evening, when pollen-filled buds sway / like the gentle breeze that stirs the great forest, / O you with the bright forehead who smells cool and fragrant! / If you are in pain, I shall speak of what I have seen. / Like a foolish man who climbed, without knowing, / the great delusion of the mountain slope where large beehives sleep, / this world is not bewildered. / While we are here, he will not separate from us, be assured!",
 "translation": "O girl with the bright forehead, smelling as cool and fragrant as the gentle breeze that stirs the great forest at evening, making the pollen-filled buds sway! If you are in pain, I will tell you what I see. This world is not so foolish as a simpleton who climbs a steep mountain slope where massive beehives hang, without knowing how to get down. He will not leave us while we are here; be assured of this!",
 "modern": "மாலை நேரத்தில், மகரந்தம் நிறைந்த மொட்டுகள் அசையும்படி பெருங்காட்டில் வீசுகின்ற மெல்லிய காற்றைப் போல, குளுமையான நறுமணம் வீசும் ஒளி பொருந்திய நெற்றியை உடையவளே! நீ வருத்தமுற்றால் நான் கண்ட உண்மையைச் சொல்கிறேன். பெரிய தேன்கூடுகள் நிறைந்த மலைச்சரிவில், இறங்கும் வழி அறியாமல் ஏறிய அறிவிலியைப் போல இவ்வுலகம் ஏமாந்து போகாது. நாம் உயிருடன் இருக்கும்போது அவன் நம்மைப் பிரிந்து செல்ல மாட்டான், இதனை உறுதியாக நம்புவாயாக.",
 "explanation": "In this poem, the friend (தோழி) is speaking to the heroine (தலைவி) to comfort her. The hero is planning to depart for wealth through the harsh desert path (பாலை), and the heroine is deeply distressed and anxious about the impending separation. The friend reassures her that the hero will not leave her. She compares the world (or the hero's potential mistake) to a foolish person who climbs a high mountain slope to reach a beehive without knowing how to descend safely. This belongs to the Pālai (desert/separation) landscape, where the dangerous and difficult path represents the risk of losing his beloved. The key words are 'ஒண்ணுதலோயே' (O bright-foreheaded one), 'பிரியலன்' (he will not separate), and 'தெளிமே' (be assured).",
